title: "Authority Before Action: A Conditional Failure-Chain Framework for Tool-Using AI Safety"
authors:
  - family-names: "Naing"
    given-names: "Htet Ko Ko"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6140-0495"
version: "v1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-04"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20541041"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20541041"
type: article
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: "A conceptual and operational framework for analyzing authority failures in tool-using AI systems. The work introduces authority assignment, commitment boundaries, release/action gates, STA bottleneck coding, and a reproducible benchmark specification. It does not report executed benchmark results or claim deployment safety."
keywords:
